From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000018 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CEB-GNRD simulator <qemu-ceb-gnrd@localhost>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 18:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] aspeed: integrate host eSPI, USB vHub, chassis and VGA models

Route legacy COM1/KCS/POST I/O through the Peripheral channel and model
software readiness, reset and boot Virtual Wires. Add QMP host USB tokens
for the real Linux gadget drivers and the CHASI# sticky latch. Finish VGA
mode detection without input and limit JPEG DMA size.

This is a software-test model: eSPI OOB/flash, USB isochronous transfers,
electrical timing and migration of the new controllers are not implemented.
Apply after the existing 0001..0017 patches against QEMU 11.0.2.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [CEB-GNRD simulation only]
---
diff --git a/hw/arm/aspeed_ast2600.c b/hw/arm/aspeed_ast2600.c
